            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Draftava 1.2.1

This maintenance release fixes a launch failure introduced in Draftava 1.2.0.

- Fixed Draftava failing to open when Sparkle was embedded in locally signed builds.
- Improved release validation so packaged builds are launch-tested before publishing.
- Improved update packaging checks to catch signing and bundle metadata problems before release.
]]></description>
